assets/thq-connect-root.pem is the public THQ Connect Root CA certificate
from the Darksiders II PS3 client, included for interoperability.
SHA-256 (DER):
d86d20e06db3f01be90bb7743c1e799e776e12a09023ca5d327df8b94bf35029
No THQ private CA key is included. No ownership or MIT licensing of this
third-party certificate is claimed.

assets/psn-darksiders2-key.json contains the public ECDSA verification point
for PSN signer 4ca0c71d, recovered offline from signed tickets. It is used only
for signature verification. No Sony private key is included or derived.
No ownership or MIT licensing of this verification key is claimed.

psn_auth.py independently implements the NP ticket TLV/signature format.
Format references:
https://github.com/LBPUnion/ProjectLighthouse/blob/main/Documentation/Tickets.md
https://github.com/LBPUnion/ProjectLighthouse/pull/600
LittleBigRefresh/NPTicket was consulted as a format reference. No third-party
implementation or AGPL source is bundled.

Darksiders, THQ and PlayStation identify the compatible game and platform.
